# MeshCore scope

`CONSTITUTION.md` wins if this rule disagrees with it.

New MeshCore work for this product lands in this repository (UV-PRO). `atakmaps/TAK-MESHCORE` stays published until the maintainer freezes it.

Do not port a fix into `TAK-MESHCORE` unless the maintainer asks. Do not edit that repo "for parity" in the same task.
